DeskSpan 0.1.0
Copyright 2026 DeskSpan contributors

DeskSpan is an independent downstream work for multi-computer workstations.
The additions dated 2026-11-18 are the terminal layout wizard, multi-device
arrangement and status commands, installer launchers, tests and release tooling.
DeskSpan contributors release these additions under GPL-3.0-only (see LICENSE).

Upstream attribution
Oink — Oink Is Not only a KVM, by Hachiwii and the Oink contributors
https://github.com/oinkvm/oink/releases/tag/v0.3.6
The DeskSpan layout calculations use the native-to-canvas transform documented
and implemented in crates/oink-agent/src/main.rs in that release. The runtime
source archive is reproduced as published, with its attribution, license,
section 7 additional terms and third-party notices. For upstream material
see LICENSE-ADDITIONAL-TERMS.md and the upstream archive's NOTICE, LICENSE,
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md, third-party-licenses.json and licenses/ directory.
DeskSpan uses the published local agent interface of that release.

DeskSpan platform kits include the corresponding DeskSpan source archive.
The install launcher retrieves the upstream platform installer from its original
release URL. Each downloaded component retains its own terms and attribution.
DeskSpan binaries use the Go standard library. Its license is included as
Go-LICENSE.txt in each platform kit.
